libva-v4l2 (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Stamp encoder buffers with the real frame period so firmware rate
    control honors CBR/VBR bitrates. Fixes severe quality loss (max QP)
    in rate-controlled encodes.
  * Add build.sh; packages are collected in ./output.
  * Expose VA quality levels 1-4 and map them to RC maximum-QP ceilings
    (30/37/44/51), so clients such as Sunshine can trade quality for speed.
  * Advertise and emulate QVBR (VBR with a quality QP ceiling), ICQ
    (fixed QP seeded from the quality factor), and AVBR (CBR), so clients
    no longer fall back silently for those rate-control selections.

 -- willxluke <durianxe@outlook.com>  Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:05:00 +0800

